{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1061904/block/singleImage/3257282/df/01M6J5QZN5C0JX2QAB2HSSVCDW.jpg?updatedAt=1793758912\"/><figcaption>尖沙咀發生盜竊案。（Google地圖截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>尖沙咀發生盜竊案。 昨日（3日）晚上11時許，一名78歲非華裔男子，發現其位於尖沙咀亞士厘道10至14號雅士洋樓的住所有財物不翼而飛，懷疑被人盜去。於是報警。警方接報後到場，經初步點算，相信上址有總值約27萬元的珠寶不知所終。警方經初步調查，將案件列作「盜竊」，交由油尖警區刑事調查隊第四隊跟進，暫未有人被捕。據了解，老翁來自印度，持有本港身份證；另外，事主懷疑妻子涉案，警方正調查案件。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T03:44:50.763628+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":216,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T02:21:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T16:58:21.044707+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T03:38:27.521052+00:00","content_hash":"0a9ccae09a99c276c3c3a04c7a41c3bee6bc3178995c23b78643cff945ac3662","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T03:44:50.763628+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}